ra (200 – 2000 m/z) were acquired at a resolution of 15000 in the Orbitrap analyzer with a fixed mass of 145 m/z. Only peptides with charge states ranging from +2 to +6 were included for fragmentation and the dynamic exclusion was set to 12 s.\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
